description: asyncio worker conventions
alwaysApply: true
---

# Worker

- One unit of work = one application use case (`ProcessTick`); the loop in `worker.py` only schedules.
- Never swallow `asyncio.CancelledError`; stop through the shutdown event.
- Keep ticks idempotent and bounded in time.
- Run `uv run ruff check .` and `uv run pytest` before claiming done.
